    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-16",
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "change": "v7强化：match段新增prefer_download_file_point/precise_year_month_lookup/strict_conversation_id_check/fallback_to_full_scan四项配置，强化会话-文件-缓存三联动防串客户"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-16",
      "version": "1.2.0",
      "change": "v7迭代3：新增path_vars段变量化所有路径（${WXWORK_ROOT}/${UID}/${USERPROFILE}），新增verify-association子命令，load_config_with_vars函数支持环境变量覆盖"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-16",
